OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be be mainly cloudy
OL,6,Fwith outbreaks of rain in the morning,
OL,7,Fturning more showery in the afternoon
OL,8,Fwith some brighter spells developing
OL,9,Flater.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FChance of some showers at
OL,12,Ffirst but otherwise largely dry
OL,13,Fthrough the evening and overnight with
OL,14,Fvariable cloud and clear spells. Some
OL,15,Flight showers again in the west by
OL,16,Fmorning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
