OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FVariable cloud and bright or
OL,6,Fsunny spells through the day. Mostly
OL,7,Fdry but the odd light shower. Turning
OL,8,Fcloudier later with outbreaks of light
OL,9,Frain spreading east.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FAn
OL,12,Funsettled and changeable period with
OL,13,Foccasional rain or showers, rain
OL,14,Flikely heavy at times, but feeling
OL,15,Fwarm in any sunshine.
